# Materialized nix-pinned upstream sources (scripts/buck-src.nu). Content is
# pinned in nix/submodules.json, so it is reproducible and never committed.
# Only this file and the BUCK file that builds those trees are tracked.
*
# Anchored: the pins bring their own .gitignore files, and an unanchored exception
# un-ignores every one of them the moment the pin directories are un-ignored below.
!/.gitignore
!/BUCK
# The per-pin packages (plan/buck2-port.md phase 3): vendor/src/<pin>/BUCK is committed
# too. A directory has to be un-ignored before a file inside it can be, and the pattern
# is anchored to ONE level so nothing walks the pins' contents looking for more.
!/*/
!/*/BUCK
